# Data-pipeline template — extra runtime knobs merged by `enclave init` (core keys are generated for you).
# NO inline comments after values.
# A pipeline agent EXTRACTS from read-only sources (cloud warehouses, object stores, HTTP APIs),
# transforms LOCALLY in its work dir, and STAGES external loads for a fire step — it never executes a
# destructive cloud/DB write itself (the guard blocks those). Enable the read-only cloud profile so it
# can pull from BigQuery/GCS/S3 sources: reads allowed; writes/deploy/IAM/DML blocked.
GUARD_CLOUD_READONLY=1
